{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You wake up in a small, locked office. You can\u2019t move from your chair, and the only thing in front of you is a desk covered in strange objects. A woman\u2019s voice comes through a speaker, just as lost and confused as you are. As you start to interact with what\u2019s around you, every choice you make begins to pull you deeper into a strange and uneasy story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598450/extras/1bec5d408f73caf705fb8cc019ba2aef.avif?t=1761867703\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weighty Choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape the outcome, leading to different revelations and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598450/extras/01ac321b94d2cce0bbb82bafb4e06c02.poster.avif?t=1761867703\" width=800 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598450/extras/01ac321b94d2cce0bbb82bafb4e06c02.webm?t=1761867703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the mysteries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chilling supernatural story unfolds as you dig deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598450/extras/67cd9438a4e9ba90c8d0a28dfc7c6aa9.poster.avif?t=1761867703\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598450/extras/67cd9438a4e9ba90c8d0a28dfc7c6aa9.webm?t=1761867703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped and Powerless</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot walk; you only interact with the desk in front of you. Every choice you make matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598450/extras/1d9c28734324948e9336ecabd4039109.poster.avif?t=1761867703\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598450/extras/1d9c28734324948e9336ecabd4039109.webm?t=1761867703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Environment</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine objects, uncover hidden details, and manipulate your surroundings to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598450/extras/13c1a26c155638cd6f8df1bc2abe74cb.poster.avif?t=1761867703\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598450/extras/13c1a26c155638cd6f8df1bc2abe74cb.webm?t=1761867703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598450?t=1761867703","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598450/034ec96b1d7866a576